      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Veteran mare LOVE AND PAIN (5) returned from a ten-month spell and was lining up for only the second time when a desperately close second over 870m at Toowoomba last start. Only needs to show a little natural improvement off that run to be taking this out. LUMINOUS GIRL (6) has finally struck some form of late. Closed well but found one better last start over this distance at Warwick. Nicely drawn and should give a good account again. CLIFFS HANGER (2) is a new arrival in the Sonya Dixon stable and is first-up after a four-month spell. Failed to place in five starts in Victoria but was competitive in better races than this at the start of last prep. Good enough to win - betting holds the key. LADY ESTELLE (10) had her chance but finished a distant third on debut recently over 870m at Toowoomba. Can do better with that race experience now on board. SUNSET ADIOS (9) showed pace but weakened on debut last start over 1000m. Likely improver dropping back to this trip.",
